After the counterfactual the worktree file was restored and its sha256 equals the recorded fixed hash
`e3bd0cd23b30f6948becf681030ec402ee59380f31f1ff21bdf172de5ce8c80e`.

The pre-fix failure was also named through the real generated code path
(`evidence/f32-prefix-test-class-probe.log`). The generated f32 test class with the literal restored
to the pre-fix form, compiled against the generated f32 runtime, reports:

```
